---

Additional note on operational use: this repository is a collection of
diagnostic SQL scripts, runbooks, and documentation intended to assist
database engineers operating Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL-Compatible Edition.
It is provided for operational reference purposes only. Running any script
against a production database is done at the operator's own risk; always
review a script's header (safety classification, required privileges, and
expected impact) and validate it against a non-production environment
before running it against a business-critical system. See
`docs/production-safety/README.md` and `CONTRIBUTING.md` for the safety
model and standards that govern content in this repository.
